OL,3,APalestine Action ban undermined
OL,4,Aconfidence in anti-terror laws, Supreme
OL,5,ACourt told
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe banning of Palestine Action has led
OL,8,Fto a "crisis in confidence" in the UK's
OL,9,Fanti-terrorism laws and triggered
OL,10,Funprecedented civil disobedience from
OL,11,Flaw-abiding protesters, the Supreme
OL,12,FCourt has been told.
OL,14,FOpening a major legal challenge to the
OL,15,Fgroup's proscription last year, lawyers
OL,16,Ffor co-founder Huda Ammori said that no
OL,17,Fother protest organisation had been
OL,18,Ftreated the same way.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
