OL,3,APalestine Action ban undermined
OL,4,Aconfidence in anti-terror laws, Supreme
OL,5,ACourt told
OL,6,
OL,7,FThey told the five justices that the
OL,8,FUK's highest court had never before had
OL,9,Fto consider whether banning a group
OL,10,Funder terrorism legislation was
OL,11,Fcompatible with freedom of speech and
OL,12,Fprotest.
OL,14,FTwenty-seven protesters were arrested
OL,15,Foutside the Supreme Court on Wednesday
OL,16,Fas the hearing took place, the
OL,17,FMetropolitan Police said.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
